{"title":"List of regional mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Regional_mathematics_competitions\">Regional mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_regional_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Regional mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Trigonometry_Challenge\" title=\"International Trigonometry Challenge\">International Trigonometry Challenge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asian_Pacific_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Asian Pacific Mathematical Olympiad (page does not exist)\">Asian Pacific Mathematical Olympiad</a> (APMO)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Australasian_Schools_Mathematics_Assessment&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Australasian Schools Mathematics Assessment (page does not exist)\">Australasian Schools Mathematics Assessment</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://euclidlab.org/programs/archmidean-challenge/\">Archimedean Challenge #1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Balkan Mathematical Olympiad\">Balkan Mathematical Olympiad</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Junior Balkan Mathematical Olympiad\">Junior Balkan Mathematical Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Baltic_Way&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Baltic Way (page does not exist)\">Baltic Way</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Online_MathChamps_Contest\" title=\"Online MathChamps Contest\">Online MathChamps Contest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Nordic_Mathematical_Contest\" title=\"Nordic Mathematical Contest\">Nordic Mathematical Contest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Southeast_Asian_Mathematics_Olympiad\" title=\"Southeast Asian Mathematics Olympiad\">Southeast Asian Mathematics Olympiad</a> (SEAMO)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=United_States_of_America_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"United States of America Mathematical Olympiad\">United States of America Mathematical Olympiad</a> (USAMO) includes Canadian participation</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=William_Lowell_Putnam_Competition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"William Lowell Putnam Competition\">William Lowell Putnam Competition</a> includes Canadian as well as United States undergraduate students.</li>\n<li>Czech-Polish-Slovak competition</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=The_Mani-Cretin_Mathematical_Examinations\" title=\"The Mani-Cretin Mathematical Examinations\">The Mani-Cretin Mathematical Examinations</a> (MCME, MCOMT)</li></ul>\n<p>Competition problems online at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathlinks&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mathlinks (page does not exist)\">Mathlinks</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=1&amp;cid=20\">Asian Pacific Mathematical Olympiad Problems</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.etc.unsw.edu.au/pdf/MathsBrochure0.2.pdf\">ASMA information</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=1&amp;cid=19\">BMO problems</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=1&amp;cid=21\">JBMO problems</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=1&amp;cid=60\">Baltic Way problems</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SEAMEO_Mathematics_Olympiad\">SEAMO information</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27\">USAMO problems</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=2&amp;cid=23\">Putnam problems</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_regional_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=188\">International Contests &amp; Programs Forum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Olympiad_math&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Olympiad math (page does not exist)\">Olympiad math</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_regional_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_international_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of international mathematics competitions\">List of international mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Resources_for_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"Resources for mathematics competitions\">Resources for mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_books\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Math books\">Math books</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017154651\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 22/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1392:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017154651 and revision id 176260. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}